    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8b35cf06-6686-4eb7-a89f-2527f1daae4c-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_TendererQualificationRequest1_SpecificTendererRequirement1>,
